
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Loan Terms & Conditions - QuickLoan{% endblock %}

{% block head %}
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<style>
    :root {
        --navy: #060d1f;
        --surface: #111827;
        --card: #161d2e;
        --blue: #3b82f6;
        --cyan: #38bdf8;
        --white: #f0f6ff;
        --muted: #8892a4;
        --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
        background: var(--navy);
        color: var(--white);
        font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        padding-top: 80px;
    }

    .terms-nav {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        z-index: 100;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 20px 5%;
        background: rgba(6,13,31,.95);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .logo {
        font-size: 23px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--white);
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .logo span { color: var(--cyan); }

    .back-link {
        color: #93c5fd;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 13px;
    }

    .terms-container {
        max-width: 950px;
        margin: 45px auto;
        padding: 0 20px 60px;
    }

    .terms-header {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 35px;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        color: var(--cyan);
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 38px);
        margin: 15px 0 10px;
    }

    h1 span { color: var(--cyan); }

    .subtitle {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .notice {
        background: rgba(59,130,246,.09);
        border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,.25);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 18px;
        margin-top: 22px;
        color: #bfdbfe;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .terms-card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 15px;
        padding: 25px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .terms-card h2 {
        font-size: 17px;
        margin-bottom: 13px;
        color: #93c5fd;
    }

    .terms-card p,
    .terms-card li {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #b8c4d8;
        line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .terms-card ul {
        padding-left: 22px;
        margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .terms-card li { margin-bottom: 7px; }

    .rate-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 12px;
        margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .rate-card {
        background: var(--card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 18px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .rate-card strong {
        display: block;
        color: var(--cyan);
        font-size: 27px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .rate-card span {
        font-size: 11px;
        color: var(--muted);
    }

    .terms-footer {
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
        padding: 25px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        margin-top: 30px;
    }

    @media(max-width: 600px) {
        .terms-header { padding: 23px; }
        .terms-card { padding: 20px; }
        .rate-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
</style>

<nav class="terms-nav">
    <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="logo">
        Quick<span>Loan</span>
    </a>

    <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="back-link">
        ← Back to home
    </a>
</nav>

<main class="terms-container">

    <header class="terms-header">
        <div class="eyebrow">Customer agreement</div>

        <h1>Terms & <span>Conditions</span></h1>

        <p class="subtitle">
            Please read these terms carefully before registering for an
            account or applying for a loan with QuickLoan.
            These terms explain how applications are assessed, how
            interest is determined, and what is expected from borrowers.
        </p>

        <div class="notice">
            <strong>Important:</strong>
            Registering an account does not guarantee loan approval.
            Every loan application is subject to assessment, approval
            and a separate credit agreement.
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>1. Registration and Account Information</h2>

        <p>
            By registering with QuickLoan, you agree to provide accurate,
            complete and up-to-date personal information.
            This includes your full name, contact details, employment
            information and any other information reasonably required
            to assess your loan application.
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>You must provide truthful information during registration and application.</li>
            <li>You are responsible for keeping your login credentials secure.</li>
            <li>You must notify QuickLoan if your personal or contact information changes.</li>
            <li>You must not create an account using another person's identity.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>2. Loan Applications and Approval</h2>

        <p>
            Submitting a loan application does not mean that a loan
            has been approved. QuickLoan assesses each application
            individually before making a lending decision.
        </p>

        <p>Our assessment may consider:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Your income and employment status.</li>
            <li>Your monthly expenses and existing financial obligations.</li>
            <li>Your ability to repay the requested amount.</li>
            <li>Your credit history and available credit information, where lawfully obtained.</li>
            <li>The amount requested and the overall risk associated with the application.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            QuickLoan may approve, decline or offer a different loan
            amount based on the assessment. Approval is not guaranteed.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>3. Interest Rates and Risk Assessment</h2>

        <p>
            QuickLoan uses a risk-based assessment process to determine
            the applicable loan terms. Depending on the product,
            assessment outcome and applicable legal limits, the
            proposed interest rate may fall within one of the following
            indicative pricing tiers:
        </p>

        <div class="rate-grid">
            <div class="rate-card">
                <strong>30%</strong>
                <span>Indicative lower pricing tier</span>
            </div>

            <div class="rate-card">
                <strong>40%</strong>
                <span>Indicative middle pricing tier</span>
            </div>

            <div class="rate-card">
                <strong>50%</strong>
                <span>Indicative higher pricing tier</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p>
            These percentages are indicative business pricing tiers,
            not a promise that these rates can be charged on every loan.
            The actual interest rate must comply with applicable
            South African credit legislation and the rules for the
            specific type of credit agreement.
        </p>

        <p>
            Before accepting a loan, you will be provided with a
            quotation or pre-agreement statement showing the applicable
            interest rate, fees, repayment schedule and total amount
            payable.
        </p>

        <p>
            You should only accept the loan if you understand and agree
            to the disclosed costs and repayment obligations.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>4. Loan Amount and Repayment</h2>

        <p>
            The approved loan amount may differ from the amount
            originally requested. The final amount depends on the
            affordability and risk assessment.
        </p>

        <p>Your individual loan agreement will specify:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>The approved principal loan amount.</li>
            <li>The applicable interest rate and other permitted charges.</li>
            <li>The total amount repayable.</li>
            <li>The repayment dates and instalment amounts.</li>
            <li>The loan commencement date and expected settlement date.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            You are responsible for making payments in accordance
            with the repayment schedule in your loan agreement.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>5. Missed or Late Payments</h2>

        <p>
            You must make repayments by their agreed due dates.
            If you anticipate difficulty making a payment, contact
            QuickLoan as soon as possible.
        </p>

        <p>
            If a payment is missed or overdue, QuickLoan may take
            the steps permitted by your credit agreement and applicable
            law. These may include:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Contacting you regarding the overdue payment.</li>
            <li>Requesting payment of the overdue amount.</li>
            <li>Applying interest on overdue amounts where legally permitted and contractually agreed.</li>
            <li>Applying permitted default administration charges or collection costs where applicable.</li>
            <li>Taking lawful steps to recover outstanding amounts.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            No additional interest, penalty or charge will be imposed
            merely because a payment is missed unless it is permitted
            by law and properly provided for in the applicable credit
            agreement. Charges will not be added arbitrarily.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>6. Loan Extensions and Renewals</h2>

        <p>
            A borrower who cannot settle a loan by its original due date
            may request an extension, subject to approval and the
            applicable credit agreement.
        </p>

        <p>
            QuickLoan may consider an extension where the borrower
            has paid the interest amount required for the proposed
            extension. The required amount and any other applicable
            conditions will be communicated before the extension is
            accepted.
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>An extension is not automatic or guaranteed.</li>
            <li>Payment of interest alone does not automatically settle the principal debt.</li>
            <li>The outstanding principal may remain payable after an extension.</li>
            <li>The revised repayment date and total cost must be disclosed.</li>
            <li>Any extension or renewal must comply with applicable credit legislation.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>7. Early Repayment</h2>

        <p>
            You may repay your outstanding loan before the scheduled
            settlement date, subject to the applicable credit agreement
            and legal requirements.
        </p>

        <p>
            Contact QuickLoan to request an updated settlement amount
            before making an early settlement payment.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>8. Personal Information and Privacy</h2>

        <p>
            QuickLoan may collect and process personal information
            necessary to register your account, assess applications,
            administer loans, process payments and meet legal obligations.
        </p>

        <p>
            Personal information must be handled in accordance with
            applicable privacy and data protection laws, including
            the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA).
        </p>

        <p>
            Your information will only be shared where necessary and
            legally permitted, including with authorised service
            providers and relevant credit bureaux where applicable.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>9. Default and Debt Recovery</h2>

        <p>
            If you fail to meet your repayment obligations, QuickLoan
            may pursue lawful debt recovery procedures after following
            the applicable notice and enforcement requirements.
        </p>

        <p>
            Any recovery costs or legal charges must be permitted by
            applicable law and the relevant credit agreement.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>10. Changes to These Terms</h2>

        <p>
            QuickLoan may update these general terms when necessary.
            Material changes will be communicated through appropriate
            channels.
        </p>

        <p>
            Changes to an existing loan's interest rate, fees or
            repayment obligations will only be made where permitted
            by the relevant credit agreement and applicable law.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>11. Applicable Law and Consumer Rights</h2>

        <p>
            These terms are intended to operate in accordance with
            the laws of the Republic of South Africa, including
            the National Credit Act 34 of 2005, the National Credit
            Regulations and applicable consumer protection and
            privacy legislation.
        </p>

        <p>
            Nothing in these terms removes or limits any consumer
            right that cannot lawfully be excluded.
        </p>

        <p>
            You are entitled to receive the relevant loan information
            and documents before entering into a credit agreement.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
        <h2>12. Contact and Enquiries</h2>

        <p>
            If you have questions about your account, loan application,
            repayment schedule or these terms, contact QuickLoan
            through the official communication channels provided
            on our website.
        </p>
    </section>

    <div class="terms-footer">
        © {{ "now"|date("Y") }} QuickLoan. All rights reserved.
        <br><br>
        Please read your individual loan agreement before accepting credit.
    </div>

</main>
{% endblock %}
